{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019a.q28.material.recovered", "text": "阅读案例，并回答问题。 苏老师在《现实主义美术》一课上，时而讲社会背景，时而讲创作理念和表现形式，时而讲解画家的逸闻趣事，还列举了二十几幅现实主义的美术作品，学生们听得津津有味。在讨论环节，苏老师展示米勒的作品《晚钟》，然后问大家：哪位同学能尝试鉴赏一下这幅作品？学生们感觉可说的东西很多，却无从说起……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6ebc9bd3670caebb2d6e6d2f08047c781e16641690693151aeda9a0de42e89c4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2082, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2234, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 28, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "6ebc9bd3670caebb2d6e6d2f08047c781e16641690693151aeda9a0de42e89c4"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019a.q28"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s1.k08", "ntce.gaozhong.meishu.s4.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.414.r003", "ntce.outline.414.r004", "ntce.outline.414.r005", "ntce.outline.414.r009"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.meishu.2019a.q28"], "word_count": 152, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "6ebc9bd3670caebb2d6e6d2f08047c781e16641690693151aeda9a0de42e89c4", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2082, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2234, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中美术》真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locat